<title>TANZANIA: Tanzania shilling marginally up on dollar, pound.</title>
<headline>Tanzania shilling marginally up on dollar, pound.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling edged up against the dollar and pound sterling on Thursday ahead of budget presentation by Finance Minister Daniel Yona.</p>
<p>The central Bank of Tanzania said the shilling exchanged at a commercial mean rate of 624.1059 compared to Wednesday's 624.1950.</p>
<p>Against the pound, the shilling exchanged at a mean rate of 1022.6007 from 1024.5865.</p>
<p>Mark Dodd +255 51 112939</p>
